{"id": "section-body-13539", "title": "Autoimmune Blistering Diseases", "chapterId": "chapter-thirteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-13539", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Autoimmune Blistering Diseases", "runs": [{"text": "Autoimmune"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Blistering"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Diseases"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1368"}}, {"id": "body-13540", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "They are a group of disorders characterized by the formation of blisters on the skin and/or mucous membranes due to an abnormal immune response that damages the skin's structural components. These include Pemphigus Vulgaris, Pemphigus Foliaceous, Bullous Pemphigoid, Dermatitis Herpetiformis, Linear IgA Dermatoses, and Cicatricial Pemphigoid.", "runs": [{"text": "They are a group of disorders characterized by the formation of blisters on the skin and/or mucous membranes due to an abnormal immune response that damages the skin's structural components. These include Pemphigus Vulgaris, Pemphigus Foliaceous, Bullous Pemphigoid, Dermatitis Herpetiformis, Linear IgA Dermatoses, and Cicatricial Pemphigoid."}]}, {"id": "body-13543", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-13544", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Tense or flaccid vesicles and bullae on the skin and mucus membranes", "runs": [{"text": "Tense or flaccid vesicles and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bullae"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and mucus membranes"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1318"}}, {"id": "body-13545", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Lesions breaks and leaving erosions", "runs": [{"text": "Lesions breaks and leaving erosions"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1318"}}, {